<title>USA: TABLE - Chrysler Corp Q2 net falls.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Chrysler Corp Q2 net falls.</headline>
<dateline>AUBURN HILLS, Mich. 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr primary		$0.70		    $1.39</p>
<p> Shr diluted		$0.70		    $1.38</p>
<p> Net			483,000		1,037,000</p>
<p> Revs		  14,388,000	     15,839,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary     685,700		  747,700</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted     689,000		  753,000</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1997 Q2 net includes unfavorable strike impact of $438 million, or $0.64/shr on after-tax basis.  </p>
<p>1996 Q2 net includes after-tax gain of $87 million for sale of defense units, and $100 million after-tax charge for writedown of Thrifty Rent-A-Car Systems Inc.</p>
<p>	  6 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr primary		$2.17		    $2.70</p>
<p> Shr diluted		$2.16		    $2.68</p>
<p> Net		    1,512,000		2,042,000</p>
<p> Revs		  30,504,000	     30,795,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary     695,800		  754,400</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted     698,800		  761,600</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)  </p>
<p>1997 Q2 worldwide factory unit shipments 738,453 vs 801,769.</p>
<p>1997 Q2 retail, fleet unit sales for U.S. and Canada 702,210 vs 773,017.</p>
<p>1997 Q2 automotive cash $7.04 billion vs $7.54 billion.</p>
<p>1997 Q2 Chrysler Financial Corp net earnings were $103 million vs $101 million.</p>
<p>1997 Q2 Chrysler Corp net earnings as percent of total revenues were 3.4 percent vs 6.5 percent.</p>
</text>
